  "text": "```systemverilog\nmodule rstgen (\n    input  logic clk_i,\n    input  logic rst_ni,\n    input  logic test_mode_i,\n    output logic rst_no,\n    output logic init_no\n);\n\n    logic [2:0] sync_rst;\n    logic init_cnt_en;\n    logic [1:0] init_cnt;\n\n    // Synchronize the asynchronous reset\n    always_ff @(posedge clk_i) begin\n        sync_rst[0] <= rst_ni;\n        sync_rst[1] <= sync_rst[0];\n        sync_rst[2] <= sync_rst[1];\n    end\n\n    // In test mode, bypass synchronization\n    assign rst_no = test_mode_i ? rst_ni : sync_rst[2];\n\n    // init_no is high for a few cycles after reset release\n    // Use a small counter to generate a short pulse\n    always_ff @(posedge clk_i) begin\n        if (!rst_no) begin\n            init_cnt <= 2'd0;\n        end else if (init_cnt < 2'd3) begin\n            init_cnt <= init_cnt + 2'd1;\n        end\n    end\n\n    assign init_no = (init_cnt >= 2'd3);\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
